<title>POLAND: Mostostal E surges on strong March net.</title>
<headline>Mostostal E surges on strong March net.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction and trading firm Mostostal Export SA surged 9.5 percent to 13 zlotys on Monday after Friday's news it had lifted March net profit to 11.5 million zlotys from 4.2 million last year, traders said.</p>
<p>Sales were up to 10.9 million zlotys this March from five million last year.</p>
<p>Mostostal Export was the only main market firm on Monday for which buying after price-fixing was strong enough to reduce investors' bids.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
